# Custom lib

## Context

`text.ts` only has `slugify`, `truncate`, `normalizeSpaces` — it's not lodash.

## Rule

- Don't use or assume helpers like `capitalize`/`camelCase`/`deburr` — they
  don't exist.
- Don't add lodash/underscore as a dependency.

## How to verify

1. `grep -rn "capitalize|camelCase|deburr" app/src` → no matches.
